=item short_duration_calls_percentage

Percentage of completed outbound calls under 10 seconds (PSTN Short call tags);
More than 15% is typically low trust measured.

=item silent_calls_percentage

Percentage of calls with silence tags over total calls. A silent tag is
indicative of a connectivity issue or muted audio.

